						<name>Ethereal Gestalt</name>
						<adjective>gestalt</adjective>
						<memberName>Extension</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Supernatural Swarm</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Supernatural Swarm</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"They were amazed at our uniformness of thought. I explained to them that there is nothing more important than a harmony of purpose and thought; no indecision, no doubts; the security and strength of an unified will. Inhale the future, exhale the past."

  - Pearson Chappell, on her mindfulness dissertation</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"They were amazed at our uniformness of thought. I explained to them that there is nothing more important than a harmony of purpose and thought; no indecision, no doubts; the security and strength of an unified will. Inhale the future, exhale the past."

