						<name>Super-Banoronism</name>
						<adjective>Banoronic</adjective>
						<memberName>Banoronite</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Victor</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Victor</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The people of the exploited mineral-planet Xanides, both Banoronites and others, lived in peace for many years under the watchful eye of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Banoron&lt;/color&gt;. A mine-corp boss arose and threatened to destroy &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Banoron&lt;/color&gt; herself using an EMP strike to the life support systems. A warrior named Jennifer 'Jen' Sedloff used blasting charges to destroy a strip mine. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Banoron&lt;/color&gt; saw Jen's ruthlessness and anointed her the rightful ruler of all humanity. Jen gathered the Banoronites in a strip mine and taught them of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Banoron&lt;/color&gt;'s wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The people of the exploited mineral-planet Xanides, both %%memberNamePlural%% and others, lived in peace for many years under the watchful eye of %%deity0_name%%. A mine-corp boss arose and threatened to destroy %%deity0_name%% %%deity0_objective%%self using an EMP strike to the life support systems. A warrior named Jennifer 'Jen' Sedloff used blasting charges to destroy a strip mine. %%Deity0_name%% saw Jen's ruthlessness and anointed her the rightful ruler of all humanity. Jen gathered the %%memberNamePlural%% in a strip mine and taught them of %%deity0_name%%'s wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>SpikeyA</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkBlue</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.248, 0.555, 0.963, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistAbstract</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>slavery</name>
								<def>Slavery_Honorable</def>
