						<name>Orgasmic Androphagy</name>
						<adjective>androphage</adjective>
						<memberName>Androphage</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Pleasing Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Pleasing Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The oldest scavenger in my division taught me the history of ancient tech, how all the myriad worlds in the Rim are filled with discarded ancient tech. He was leading me to understand that I finally figured out the only reason to be alive is to enjoy it. Every time I share the body of a foe with a new friend, I make sure they understand this."

  - &lt;i&gt;Pleasurable Family&lt;/i&gt; by Oma Billa</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The oldest scavenger in my division taught me the history of ancient tech, how all the myriad worlds in the Rim are filled with discarded ancient tech. He was leading me to understand that I finally figured out the only reason to be alive is to enjoy it. Every time I share the body of a foe with a new friend, I make sure they understand this."

  - &lt;i&gt;Pleasurable Family&lt;/i&gt; by Oma Billa</descriptionTemplate>
