						<name>Super-Plunderism</name>
						<adjective>plunderic</adjective>
						<memberName>Plunderer</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Awoken Boss</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Awoken Boss</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"I looked at this mine hypervisor, with his pitiful abyssal marines, all that power left fallow. I tried to convince him that we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

  - &lt;i&gt;Thoughts of a Great Community Cook&lt;/i&gt; by Alisa Owen</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"I looked at this mine hypervisor, with his pitiful abyssal marines, all that power left fallow. I tried to convince him that we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

  - &lt;i&gt;Thoughts of a Great Community Cook&lt;/i&gt; by Alisa Owen</descriptionTemplate>
