						<name>Post-Fealtism</name>
						<adjective>fealtist</adjective>
						<memberName>Fealtor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"The squire stopped contributing but kept eating from the common store. I killed him with a persona plasmasword. The people were shocked, but I explained that In these days our generations are not merely faced with territorial and political problems, but also with supreme issues of the existence of our faith, our civilization and our culture, which are now at stake once more. Only share these truths with those who prove their allegiance through sacrifice."

  - Toa Dosrokio, multitudinous Speech in the encampment</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"The squire stopped contributing but kept eating from the common store. I killed him with a persona plasmasword. The people were shocked, but I explained that In these days our generations are not merely faced with territorial and political problems, but also with supreme issues of the existence of our faith, our civilization and our culture, which are now at stake once more. Only share these truths with those who prove their allegiance through sacrifice."

  - Toa Dosrokio, multitudinous Speech in the encampment</descriptionTemplate>
