						<adjective>secular</adjective>
						<memberName>Spiritual person</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Great Mystic</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Great Mystic</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"A flower does not think of competing to the flower next to it. It just blooms. One thing will become increasingly clear then: That we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. That's why we're proud to express the strength of our hearts using the heels of our boots."

  - Katsumi 'Sugar' Jensen, Meditation Speech in the city</description>
